<p class="pyq-question"><strong>Q1 (SSC CGL Exam Pattern):</strong> <em>Find the error: I am looking forward (a) / to receive (b) / your reply soon (c) / No error (d).</em></p>
<details class="pyq-solution">
<summary>Click to view step-by-step solution &amp; rule</summary>
<div class="solution-content">
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (b) — should be "to receiving"</p>
<p><strong>Explanation:</strong> "Look forward to" is a fixed prepositional expression, so "to" must be followed by a gerund, not a base verb.</p>
