<div class="pyq-card">
<p class="pyq-question"><strong>Q2 (Bank PO Exam Pattern):</strong> <em>Choose the correct sentence: (a) She is used to work late. (b) She is used to working late. (c) She used to working late. (d) She use to work late.</em></p>
<details class="pyq-solution">
<summary>Click to view step-by-step solution &amp; rule</summary>
<div class="solution-content">
<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (b) She is used to working late.</p>
<p><strong>Explanation:</strong> "Be used to" (accustomed to) uses "to" as a preposition, which must be followed by a gerund, not a base verb.</p>
